Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sujet": "Ticket batch 1",
  "description": "Test de charge 1",
  "statut": "Ouvert",
  "zoneId": 1
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/IncidentTickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sujet": "Ticket batch 2",
  "description": "Test de charge 2",
  "statut": "Ouvert",
  "zoneId": 2
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/IncidentTickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sujet": "Ticket batch 3",
  "description": "Test de charge 3",
  "statut": "Ouvert",
  "zoneId": 3
}

### 10.2 Tester la concurrence: 2 assignations simultanées
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/IncidentTickets/{{ticketId}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

"user-A"

###
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/IncidentTickets/{{ticketId}}/assign
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

"user-B"

### 10.3 Changements de statut rapides successifs
